From: CEB-GNRD maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Event logs: label the actions column

Show an explicit heading for export and delete actions in the two supported
board UI languages.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD-specific UI languages]

diff --git a/src/views/Logs/EventLogs/EventLogs.vue b/src/views/Logs/EventLogs/EventLogs.vue
--- a/src/views/Logs/EventLogs/EventLogs.vue
+++ b/src/views/Logs/EventLogs/EventLogs.vue
@@ -344,7 +344,7 @@
         {
           key: 'actions',
           sortable: false,
-          label: '',
+          label: i18n.global.locale.value === 'zh-CN' ? '操作' : 'Actions',
           tdClass: 'text-end text-nowrap',
         },
       ],
